 Questions</h2><div class=\"grid pt-8 text-left border-t border-zinc-900 md:gap-16  md:grid-cols-2\"><div><div class=\"mb-6\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Question\"><h3 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"flex items-center mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-100 \">Will the person know if I’ve taken a screenshot while viewing their story anonymously?</h3><div itemprop=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\"><div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"text-gray-400\">No, Insacret does not notify users when someone takes a screenshot of their story.</div></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Question\"><h3 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"flex items-center mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-100 \">How can I view highlights?</h3><div itemprop=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\"><div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"text-gray-400\">Tap the highlight you want to view from the highlights list at the bottom of the user profile.</div></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Question\"><h3 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"flex items-center mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-100 \">Can I see who is tagged in a story?</h3><div itemprop=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\"><div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"text-gray-400\">Yes, you can check the people mentioned by clicking the ⓘ button in the top right corner of the story.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-7\"><div class=\"mb-6\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Question\"><h3 itemprop=\"name",
